  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebbe3d2027f356bcb7877bb116ec4e0e9f132ef1b027d38df9bd08205965f30f.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **× and +**\n\n→ 24 × **54 ÷ 18** - 48 + 16 = 40\n\n→ **24 × 3** - 48 + 16 = 40\n\n→ **72** - 48 **+**** 16** = 40\n\n→ 88 - 48 = 40\n\n→ 40 = 40\n\n→ **LHS = RHS**\n\n2) **÷ and ×**\n\n→ 24 + 54 × 18 - **48 ÷ 16** = 40\n\n→ 24 + **54 ****×**** 18** - 3 = 40\n\n→ **24 + 972** - 3 = 40\n\n→ 996 - 3 = 40\n\n→ 993 ≠ 40\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **÷ and +**\n\n→ **24 ÷ 54** + 18 - 48 × 16 = 40\n\n→ 4/9 + 18 - **48 × 16** = 40\n\n→ **4/9 +**** 18** - 768 = 40\n\n→ 18.4 - 768 = 40\n\n→ -749.6 ≠ 40\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **+ and -**\n\n→ 24 - **54 ÷ 18** + 48 × 16 = 40\n\n→ 24 - 3 + **48 × 16** = 40\n\n→ **24** - 3 **+ 768** = 40\n\n→ 792 - 3 = 40\n\n→ 789 ≠ 40\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× and +\"**.",
